95312,"node_id":"MDk6TWlsZXN0b25lMjk1MzEy","number":3,"title":"2.0 Beta","description":"* All code should be completed\r\n* No more new major features\r\n* Switch to issue fixing mode\r\n* Documentation work in progress or close to complete\r\n* No guarantee of BC","creator":{"login":"qiangxue","id":993322,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk5MzMyMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/993322?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/qiangxue","html_url":"https://github.com/qiangxue","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qiangxue/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qiangxue/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qiangxue/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qiangxue/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qiangxue/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qiangxue/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qiangxue/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qiangxue/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qiangxue/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":0,"closed_issues":839,"state":"closed","created_at":"2013-03-25T02:56:51Z","updated_at":"2016-01-12T11:04:36Z","due_on":"2014-04-13T07:00:00Z","closed_at":"2014-04-14T07:56:14Z"},"comments":13,"created_at":"2013-12-06T12:04:04Z","updated_at":"2013-12-06T14:51:59Z","closed_at":"2013-12-06T14:43:37Z","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"Hi,\n\nOn my production server I have configured Yii's log module to send me an e-mail whenever any error (except for 404's) occurs.\n\nI used this configuration in my parameters:\n\n``` php\n    'components.log' => [\n        'traceLevel' => 0,\n        'targets' => [\n            'file' => [\n                'class' => 'yii\\log\\FileTarget',\n                'levels' => ['error', 'warning'],\n            ],\n            'email' => [\n                'class' => 'yii\\log\\EmailTarget',\n                'except' => ['yii\\web\\HttpException\\404'],\n                'levels' => ['error', 'warning'],\n                'message' => ['from' => 'webmaster@mydomain.com', 'to' => 'webmaster@mydomain.com'],\n            ],\n        ],\n    ]\n```\n\nThe result was that no pages are rendered, and the log in the /runtime folder was not filled. When looking in my syslogs, I found this error:\n\n```\nAllowed memory size of 134217728 bytes exhausted (tried to allocate 130968 bytes) in /home/web/vendor/yiisoft/yii2/yii/BaseYii.php on line 47\n```\n\nWhen I increase PHP's allowed memory size in php.ini, the number of exhausted bytes just goes up.\n\nWhen I remove the email target, it works again. Sending e-mails also works on my machine. When I call \\Yii::$app->mail->compose() in a script, I'm perfectly able to send an e-mail.\n\nAny idea why this is happening?\nI'm using PHP 5.5, Apache2 and Ubuntu.\n","closed_by":{"login":"qiangxue","id":993322,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk5MzMyMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/993322?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/qiangxue","html_url":"https://github.com/qiangxue","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qiangxue/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qiangxue/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qiangxue/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qiangxue/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qiangxue/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qiangxue/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qiangxue/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qiangxue/events{/privacy}","received_even